#define TX_TRIGGER 2
#define FIFO_USED 1
#define LOOPs 10

+ #define LOOPs 10 => 10 times to send msg

+ If FIFO_USED is set to 0, no fifo used
+ If FIFO_USED is set to 1 and TX_TRIGGER is set a number, interrupt is raised whenever a number + 1 of writes are performed

===
sudo cat /dev/spi0 to see how many times 
Jump IRQ = 4, jump w = 10 => 10 writes and 4 irq jumps (1 for lowering CS, 3 for irq after a nu,ber of writes)
